[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12604.469, "timestamp": "03:30:04", "text": "人也很多。 感觉仍然像是一次旅行。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12606.87, "timestamp": "03:30:06", "text": "我不知道为什么。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12609.59, "timestamp": "03:30:09", "text": "感觉不像是在旅行，感觉像是在参加"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12613.83, "timestamp": "03:30:13", "text": "学校组织的旅行之类的活动。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12618.55, "timestamp": "03:30:18", "text": "不知为何，我竟然不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12622.309, "timestamp": "03:30:22", "text": "怀念家乡，我觉得这"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12631.03, "timestamp": "03:30:31", "text": "嗯？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12633.91, "timestamp": "03:30:33", "text": "我好像经常这么说，对吧？ 也许是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12636.87, "timestamp": "03:30:36", "text": "因为我已经拿到签证，而且我必须"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12640.229, "timestamp": "03:30:40", "text": "在4月1日立即登上飞机"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12643.19, "timestamp": "03:30:43", "text": "。 或许是因为匆忙"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12646.229, "timestamp": "03:30:46", "text": "或其他原因，我感觉自己好像并不身处"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12648.87, "timestamp": "03:30:48", "text": "此地。 我不知道。 请再给我们一些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12653.269, "timestamp": "03:30:53", "text": "时间。 不，我不想搬家。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12656.389, "timestamp": "03:30:56", "text": "但是，嗯，我怀念的一件事就是，你知道，"}]